  <div class="section" id="market-overview">
    <div class="section-label">Section 01</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Market Overview &amp; Long-Term Price Trend</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Gold's 25-year price arc captures five distinct structural phases, from a multi-year base at sub-$300 through multiple accelerating bull markets culminating in a historic 2025–26 surge.</p>

    <!-- Annual price chart -->
    <div class="chart-wrap">
      <div class="chart-title">Gold Annual Closing Price (USD) — 2000–2026</div>
